Model Scope and Parameters for the Northrup F-5 Tiger II: 

States - Translational Motion
x - position in x
y - position in y
z - position in z

Linear Velocities - 
u - forward velocity 
v -sideways velocity
w - vertical velocity

Angular orientation - 
ϕ — roll
θ — pitch
𝜓 - yaw

Angular rates - 
p - roll rate
q - pitch rate
r - yaw rate

Therefore X = [x,y,z,u,v,w,ϕ,θ,𝜓,p,q,r] for the state vector

Forces - 
Lift L 
Drag D
Thrust T
Weight W
  
